You can have a working backend on [Appwrite Cloud](https://cloud.appwrite.io) in a few minutes, with [Auth](/docs/products/auth), [Databases](/docs/products/databases), [Storage](/docs/products/storage), [Functions](/docs/products/functions), and [Sites](/docs/products/sites) available from the same console. When your requirements change, the [self-hosting guide](/docs/advanced/self-hosting) gets the same stack running on your own infrastructure without touching your application code. Start where your team is today, not where you think you will be in two years.

